  "ingredients": [
    "1 large egg",
    "1 tablespoon butter (melted)",
    "2 tablespoon almond flour",
    "2 tablespoon unsweetened cocoa powder",
    "1 1/2 tablespoon erythritol",
    "1/4 cup shredded mozzarella"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all of the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chaffle/#wprm-recipe-54539-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Keto-Chocolate-Chaffle-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat up a waffle iron and brush with some melted butter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chaffle/#wprm-recipe-54539-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Keto-Chocolate-Chaffle-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, whisk the egg with melted butter. Add in the unsweetened cocoa powder, almond flour, and erythritol.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chaffle/#wprm-recipe-54539-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/ea562d2fd34a946778747153211c6d58.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk to combine well until it is smooth in consistency.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chaffle/#wprm-recipe-54539-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Keto-Chocolate-Chaffle-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the mozzarella cheese and stir well to coat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chaffle/#wprm-recipe-54539-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Keto-Chocolate-Chaffle-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Evenly place the batter into the pre-heated waffle iron. Close and follow the waffle maker instructions. Cook waffles until you have used up all of the batter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chaffle/#wprm-recipe-54539-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Keto-Chocolate-Chaffle-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve immediately and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-chaffle/#wprm-recipe-54539-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
